    "created_at": "2018-02-28T17:07:43Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-02-28T17:07:43Z",
    "body": "I agree that decode() should be a no-op for vector images. You may think that we could use it to do layout on an SVG image, but layout has to happen for each time the image is rendered at a different aspect ratio, so a pre-emptive layout inside decode() doesn't get you anything.",
